      doc: Draws the pie. @param g2  the graphics device. @param plotArea  the plot area. @param info  chart rendering info.
  - `public double getDepthFactor()` (shared field(s): depthFactor)
      doc: Returns the depth factor for the chart. @return The depth factor. @see #setDepthFactor(double)
  - `public void setDepthFactor(double factor)` (shared field(s): depthFactor)
      doc: Sets the pie depth as a percentage of the height of the plot area, and sends a {@link PlotChangeEvent} to all registered listeners. @param factor  the depth factor (for example, 0.20 is twenty percent). @see #getDepthFactor()
  - `public boolean equals(Object obj)` (shared field(s): depthFactor)
      doc: Tests this plot for equality with an arbitrary object. @param obj  the object (<code>null</code> permitted). @return A boolean.

